        "original_id": "0f6c12a9-0266-5c17-ac94-66284b124b3c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Everytime\", \"Cry Me a River\"\n- People: Artani, Justin Timberlake\n- Topics: songwriting inspiration, song composition, song themes\n\nFacts:\n- According to Artani, the song \"Everytime\" was written as a response to Justin Timberlake's 2002 song \"Cry Me a River\".\n- Justin Timberlake's 2002 song \"Cry Me a River\" is an R&B song accompanied by electric piano, beatbox, guitars, synthesizers, Arabian-inspired riffs, and Gregorian chants.\n- Justin Timberlake's 2002 song \"Cry Me a River\" is about a brokenhearted man who moves on from a girlfriend who cheated on him with another man.",
